From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: match shared PMIC mux as an IOService with owned lifecycle

Publish a late board nub and match the mux through KernelConfigTables. Move
routes, consumers, IRQ state, workloop and releasable MMIO into the service.
Synchronize stop with C API users and the GIC top half before resource free.
Keep the proven callback/software IES path; no fake interrupt provider/filter.

